    "detailed_description": "In the event known as \u201cThe First Rift\u201d dimensions N737 and T415 collided, creating a shattered timeline. As this new existence slowly began to take form, that which never should have been now became a reality. The Vex Accord and the Oronix Empire, both conquerors destined to a universe of their own, were now faced with an eternal question. Would they be able to coexist?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Experience the beautiful chaos across three stages in both Campaign and Survival modes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Use the Shield and Rampage abilities at just the right time to remain unscathed during battle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 A three star ranking system will distinguish which pilots are among the best of the best<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Earn Credits to permanently upgrade your stats and power-ups<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\u00a0Defense, offense or mobility? Choosing the right ship will additionally enhance your existing capabilities",
    "about_the_game": "In the event known as \u201cThe First Rift\u201d dimensions N737 and T415 collided, creating a shattered timeline. As this new existence slowly began to take form, that which never should have been now became a reality. The Vex Accord and the Oronix Empire, both conquerors destined to a universe of their own, were now faced with an eternal question. Would they be able to coexist?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Experience the beautiful chaos across three stages in both Campaign and Survival modes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Use the Shield and Rampage abilities at just the right time to remain unscathed during battle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 A three star ranking system will distinguish which pilots are among the best of the best<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Earn Credits to permanently upgrade your stats and power-ups<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\u00a0Defense, offense or mobility? Choosing the right ship will additionally enhance your existing capabilities",
    "short_description": "Cosmic Paradox: Noire is a 2D top-down shoot \u2018em up adventure set in a world of two overlapping dimensions. Witness the battle between the Vex Accord and the Oronix Empire, increase your odds of survival with the right upgrades and choose a ship that is best suited to your playstyle.",
